By way of present petition, the petitioner seeks the following reliefs:
"(a) Call the Record of Ld. Trial Court of case titled as "STATE VS. KAMLESH VERMA & ANR" in Criminal Case No. 1229/2025, vide Case bearing FIR bearing No.289/2024 dated 15.08.2024, U/S 420/406/471 IPC which was registered at police station Dwarka South, New Delhi, against the Petitioner and co-accused Kamlesh Kumar;
(b) Set aside the order dated 08.04.2025 passed by the Hon'bIc Court of Ld. JMFC, Dwarka Courts,
New Delhi in Criminal Case No. 1229/2025, titled as State VS. Kamlesh Verma & Anr" vide Case FIR bearing No.289/2024 dated 15.08.2024 , U/S 420/406/471 IPC registered at police station Dwarka South, New Delhi;

